# Launchpad's published git SSH host key.
#
# Source: "SSH fingerprints" in the Launchpad manual:
#   https://ubuntu.com/docs/launchpad/user/reference/ssh-fingerprints/
#     git.launchpad.net (RSA)  SHA256:UNOzlP66WpDuEo34Wgs8mewypV0UzqHLsIFoqwe8dYo
# Vendored 2026-11-13 by scanning git.launchpad.net:22 and verifying the
# key's SHA256 fingerprint against the source above. git.launchpad.net
# offers only an RSA host key (the service now negotiates rsa-sha2-256/512
# signatures for it).
#
# If ssh-keyscan output stops matching this file, do NOT blind-update: verify
# the new fingerprint out-of-band against the source above first (MITM
# guard, see scripts/pin-host-keys.sh).
git.launchpad.net ssh-rsa 
